# UNSLOP: interface and copy rules

Apply these rules to every interface file and every piece of text a person will read. The full handbook is split into chapters under `{{SKILL_DIR}}/references/`; the chapter list is `{{SKILL_DIR}}/references/INDEX.md`. Read only the chapters the task touches.

Before you finish a task, run the checks on the files you changed and fix what they report:

```sh
python3 {{SKILL_DIR}}/scripts/scan.py path/to/changed/files
python3 {{SKILL_DIR}}/scripts/lint.py path/to/file.md
```

Report the output. Never claim compliance you did not check.

{{CORE}}

## Most frequent banned words

Any form counts. The full list of 350 is `{{SKILL_DIR}}/references/banned-words.txt`.

